# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# The frontend currently needs NO runtime environment variables.
#
# It calls the API at the SAME ORIGIN under /api, which is proxied to the backend:
#   - locally  → by the Vite dev server (see frontend/vite.config.js)
#   - in prod  → by Vercel rewrites (see frontend/vercel.json)
#
# If you add client configuration later, remember: Vite only exposes variables
# prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle — so NEVER put secrets in this file.
